## Interface: 16001
## Title: CraftProfit
## Notes: A list of what your characters can craft, best profit first, from Auctionator's scanned prices: what the item sells for after the auction house's cut, less what the materials cost at the auction house or a vendor. Each character's recipes are read when it opens a profession window. Click recipes to plan crafts; the Materials pane lists what to buy, with what you own counted, and makes an Auctionator shopping list. /profit
## Author: Pietjan
## Version: 1.1
## Dependencies: Auctionator
## OptionalDeps: Syndicator
## SavedVariables: CraftProfitDB

